| **Manager (Haryana)** | `manager_haryana` | `mgr_haryana@24` | Haryana | View-only dashboard, reports, date-range downloads |
| **Planning (Maalur)** | `plan_maalur` | `plan@24` | Maalur | Upload drawings, assign Job #, enter quantities |
| **Planning (Haryana)** | `plan_haryana` | `plan@24h` | Haryana | Upload drawings, assign Job #, enter quantities |
| **Purchase (Maalur)** | `purchase_maalur` | `purchase@24` | Maalur | Locked by default (unless power granted by Admin) |
| **Accounts (Maalur)** | `accounts_maalur` | `accounts@24` | Maalur | Locked by default (unless power granted by Admin) |

