### Manager Dashboard (`manager-dashboard.html`)
- Same 3×3 grid layout as Admin, locked to the manager's assigned branch.
- **View-only**: Cannot perform approvals/rejections or grant power.
- Includes date-range summary report export.

---

### Department Dashboard (`dept-dashboard.html`)
- **2-Row × 3-Col Grid** (matching `PPCADO.jpeg` sketch):
  - **Row 1**: Planning | Purchase | Consumption
  - **Row 2**: Accounts | Dispatch | Overview
- **Lock System**: Department users can only access their own department tile. Other department tiles display a 🔒 **Locked** overlay on hover.
- **Granted Power**: If Admin has granted power access to additional departments, those tiles dynamically unlock for the department user.
- **Alerts Tab**: Topbar bell icon provides real-time notification alerts (e.g., when Admin requests a revision).

